    "resource": "aws_default_security_group.default",
    "issue": "Default security group may remain with permissive default rules",
    "risk": "If `var.default_security_group_deny_all` is false or the resource is not created, the default security group can retain AWS default allow-all egress and self-referencing ingress rules, increasing the risk of unintended lateral movement and unrestricted outbound access.",
    "remediation": "Set `var.default_security_group_deny_all = true` so `aws_default_security_group.default` is created and managed. Explicitly define empty `ingress = []` and `egress = []` or only the minimum required rules in the `aws_default_security_group` resource."
  },
